.SS _module.args
Additional arguments passed to each module in addition to ones like
\f[CR]lib\f[R], \f[CR]config\f[R], and \f[CR]pkgs\f[R],
\f[CR]modulesPath\f[R].
.PP
This option is also available to all submodules.
Submodules do not inherit args from their parent module, nor do they
provide args to their parent module or sibling submodules.
The sole exception to this is the argument \f[CR]name\f[R] which is
provided by parent modules to a submodule and contains the attribute
name the submodule is bound to, or a unique generated name if it is not
bound to an attribute.
.PP
